-- ============================================================================
-- Renumber diagnostic_questions.question_number for imint-pikas-v4
-- (00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003) to match the reordered Research/diagnostic_v4_master.csv
-- (Jakob's 2026-09-14 feedback: the last ~20-30 items felt glued on at the
-- end instead of integrated with their family -- see the reorder rationale in
-- math_app/Research/diagnostic_v4_master.csv's git history).
--
-- Two-phase update (offset by +1000, then to final value) avoids colliding
-- with the (diagnostic_id, question_number) unique constraint mid-update.
-- Rows are matched and updated in place by id, so the already-completed test
-- session's diagnostic_results (which reference question_id, not
-- question_number) are unaffected.
-- ============================================================================

